{"id":"654511","name":"海参鲜虾拌菜芯","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/654511/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"对虾","amount":"2个"},{"name":"海参","amount":"2个"},{"name":"菜芯","amount":"150g"}],"sub":[{"name":"食盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"菜芯洗净改刀。","img":"images/654511/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"海参冷水下锅。","img":"images/654511/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放菜梗。","img":"images/654511/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"煮开锅。","img":"images/654511/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放菜叶烫变色捞出沥干水分备用。","img":"images/654511/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"把海参切条。","img":"images/654511/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"对虾炒菜芯剩的两只虾，去壳，对切。","img":"images/654511/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放菜芯和海参，加食盐。","img":"images/654511/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"拌匀整理一下即可。","img":"images/654511/step_9.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}